(b) Interpretation. Unless the context otherwise requires:
  (i) references to a Clause, Section or Schedule are to a clause, section or schedule of or to this Agreement;
  (ii) the singular includes the plural and vice versa, and any gender includes every gender;
  (iii) "include", "includes" and "including" are illustrative and do not limit the generality of the preceding words;
  (iv) headings are for convenience only and do not affect interpretation;
  (v) references to a statute or regulation include any subordinate legislation and any amendment, consolidation or re-enactment in force from time to time;
  (vi) "written" or "in writing" includes email and other electronic means capable of being read, stored and reproduced, unless a particular form of execution is expressly required; and
  (vii) references to "knowledge" or "awareness" mean the actual knowledge, after due enquiry, of the officers or senior managers of the relevant Party having direct responsibility for the relevant subject matter.

